      "owner": "chaizhenhua",
      "expires": "2026-12-31",
      "reason": "Three colonies survive the Work/Environment eradication. state/constants.rs declares LEGACY_UNRECORDED_AT, the sentinel ~20 Session-event projections substitute when an event carries no epoch; retiring it means making those wire times Option, which is a Managed-projection change rather than a store fix. control/models.rs stamps a catalog entry with a frozen created_at because a model has no registration event here and the upstream wire forbids null; it needs a Control-owned publication instant. official_request_witnesses.rs builds a synthetic pagination cursor whose created_at is a cursor position, not a record's observation.",
